path server-index
kind flow
author ai
group index
note How symbols and xrefs come from a language server. build walks the root and takes every file whose text hash matches the cache; the rest are parsed with tree-sitter and, if the language has a server, marked pending. index_files then asks the server for a batch of pending files' symbols and every symbol's outgoing calls, each stage sent whole with many requests in flight, and each file's answer is applied. References and incoming calls are never asked while indexing: each is a search of the whole workspace, so they are asked for one symbol when a command or the GUI wants them. The CLI indexes only the files a command touches, through Servers; the GUI indexes every pending file on a thread and greys out what is still pending.

