note The walk and the cache check. A cache hit skips parsing entirely. A cached server answer points at lines in other files, so it is asked again when any of those files changed. The walk honours .gitignore even when the root is not a git repo, and skips files over 4 MiB, or with a NUL byte in their first 1 KiB, as binary.

