symbol poll_backend
lines 0 105
hash ca960ffe74118493
note Drains every server's channel each frame, but merges at most once a second and once more when the batch ends, since a merge re-resolves the map and drops every drawn grid. A merge applies the answers and starts a link on a thread; the status line's symbol count follows each merge. A batch's end saves the cache and runs the next batch if a rebuild asked for one meanwhile. Any message at all from a server means it is past starting, so a ': starting' status gives way to the index count.

